# Plugin file-operation associations.
#
# This file is an overlay for plugin actions. It never replaces mc.ext.ini:
# when no rule here matches, Midnight Commander follows its normal extension
# and panel-plugin handling.
#
# A user may add rules in ~/.config/mc/magic.ini. Values have the exact form
# %plugin{plugin-name:operation}, for example:
#
# [archive]
# Regex=\\.(tar|tar\\.gz|tgz|zip|7z)$
# Open=%plugin{arcmc:open}

@MAGIC_ARCMC_RULES@
